  "_comment": "Canonical machine-readable category taxonomy. Single source of truth for category scope; anchors the semantic audit (tools/semantic-audit.mjs) and the deterministic taxonomy check (tools/check-taxonomy.mjs). axis: topical|functional|property (see docs/CONTENT-QUALITY.md). Examples are real content items in both languages.",
  "tieBreak": [
    "Most-specific domain wins (airport > transportation, kitchen > supermarket).",
    "Situational beats functional: a phrase that clearly fits a situational topic goes there even if it involves talking/opining.",
    "Classify by meaning, not by the verb.",
    "A real irreducible tie means the item should be OMITTED rather than forced.",
    "Vocab by POS + theme: verbs to verbos_*, adjectives to adjetivos_*, colors to colores, nouns to their theme deck, or general/Conceptos ONLY for a pure abstract concept."
